---
// Why: the name as two halves, as SideShot's is: Mer, from the Mermaid it reads, in ink, and live, what it adds,
// carrying the marigold. Marigold letters do not read on white, so on paper live is underlined in marigold; on
// charcoal the letters themselves are marigold.
---

<span class="wordmark">Mer<span class="live">live</span></span>

<style>
  .wordmark {
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .live {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--mark);
    text-decoration-thickness: 0.17em;
    text-underline-offset: 0.06em;
    text-decoration-skip-ink: none;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .live {
      color: var(--mark);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  }
</style>
